import KolmogorovMathlib.MonotoneComplexity.Omega.SolovayFunctions.ExistenceSum
import KolmogorovMathlib.MonotoneComplexity.Omega.SolovayFunctions.ExistenceFlatten

/-!
# Existence of Solovay functions

Group of the two halves of the existence proof: `ExistenceSum` constructs a Solovay function and
shows the Solovay property depends only on the sum and is invariant under computable
permutations, and `ExistenceFlatten` supplies the flattening of a double series and the
characterisation of randomness by tightness of the bound.

Source: SUV §5.7.5–5.7.6, pp. 166–168.
-/
